<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-FRENCH OPEN MEN'S SINGLES RESULTS (1515 GMT).</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FRENCH OPEN MEN'S SINGLES RESULTS (1515 GMT).</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Men's singles results on the 10th</p>
<p>day of the French Open tennis tournament on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Prefix number denotes seeding.</p>
<p>* denotes new results</p>
<p>Quarter-finals:</p>
<p>*16-Sergi Bruguera (Spain) beat Hicham Arazi (Morocco) 4-6 6-3</p>
<p>6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Patrick Rafter (Australia) beat Galo Blanco (Spain) 6-3 7-6</p>
<p>(7-3) 6-3</p>
<p>(Ends men results)</p>
</text>
